# IAM Platform root .gitignore
# Source: .gitignore.fragment (starter) + S1-00 security review additions (SEC-S1-15, F2).
# Hygiene only: this is NOT a secret-scanning control. CI secret scanning (gitleaks or equivalent) is required.

# --- Environment / local settings ---
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
.claude/settings.local.json
**/appsettings.Production.json
**/appsettings.*.local.json
**/appsettings.local.json
*.user
**/secrets/

# --- Keys, certificates, keystores, password stores ---
*.pfx
*.p12
*.key
*.pem
*.jks
*.keystore
*.snk
*.kdbx

# --- Database files, backups and dumps ---
*.bak
*.bacpac
*.dacpac
*.dump
*.backup
*.sql.gz
*.mdf
*.ldf
*.ndf

# --- Executables / installers / archives (never belong in the repo) ---
*.exe
*.msi
*.zip
*.7z
*.tar.gz
*.nupkg

# --- .NET build output ---
**/bin/
**/obj/
.vs/
TestResults/
*.trx
coverage/
**/coverage/
*.coverage
*.coveragexml

# --- Frontend build output ---
**/node_modules/
**/.angular/
**/dist/
**/playwright-report/
**/test-results/

# --- Logs and OS noise ---
*.log
logs/
Thumbs.db
.DS_Store
